  attachedPhoto: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d99e9125d5e5f574b86cb3f8c3e04de4, type: 3}
  logText: 'I have finally obtained permission to land on TRAPPIST-1 e. Protocol
    requires one person to always stay at the ship, but I argued that forcing someone
    to come would be worse, as they would need to jump several times to reach me.
    Our engines can only achieve faster-than-light travel so many times, and the
    risk of getting more people and ships stranded is greater than my own safety.


    I
    don''t have any intention of getting stuck on this planet, and while the logical
    thing to do is return, I believe that this mission is more important than anything
    else. And I know the higher-ups agree.'
